= Introduction

The book starts here. Each chapter lives in its own file in the `chapters` folder; the main file
`main.typ` includes them in order with `#include`. Title, authors, publisher and references are
in the “Document” pane of the sidebar.

A chapter always starts on a right-hand page. Above the text, left-hand pages show the book title
and right-hand pages the chapter title.

== Structure

Citations come from `literatur.bib`, for example @beispielFachbuch2026.
